/target
# Timestamped benchmark output. Committed baselines live in benches/baselines/.
/benches/results

# Committed baselines must not carry logs: this repo is public, and both the
# proxy log and the per-request access log record the backend's address, the
# share name and local paths. Reports, result tables and sccache stats are
# enough to read a baseline; the logs stay in the gitignored results dir.
/benches/baselines/**/*.log
